Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to play dead.\NLike this. Do like this, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dog, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was once human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're a dog now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Supper is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No! That's Nozomi's!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen, you're a dummy, so you\Nbrought the same order as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't she come with us, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's in a spat\Nwith a certain somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.21,0:00:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell us a funny story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something a dog can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanie. Okay, tell us\Nwhy you turned into a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I turn into a dog...?\NYeah, why did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it happened a really long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just tell us whatever\Nyou do remember, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. It was a very long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Five thousand years ago now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I was a terribly\Nill-natured young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was someone who was\Nnice enough to give me her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She possessed a special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the power to direct all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the hope of all the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and the one they all trusted\Nto make their choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She was our whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,However, our time of\Nhappiness did not last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,An epidemic hit us out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lesions became tumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and they swelled ever\Nlarger on a daily basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And even with her power to direct\Nall things, she could not heal us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair looks so clear,\Nand reminds me of snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Also... your lips are as blue as the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:02:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...project even more\Nkindness than they did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't avert your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. I want to get a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you're right. They're much\Nnicer than before. More natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one else would ever think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...would have been willing\Nto do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have been anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She never gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She fought the epidemic,\Nbelieving that she could save us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As the days wore on, I got so\NI could no longer look at her directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was too painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She was far too brilliant for me\Nto look directly at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a terrible disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Over time, the tumors\Nspread all over their bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and they no longer even looked human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Until finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, there was still some\Nhope left within all of their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They believed for certain that\Nshe would find a way to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like she was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:04:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen many worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but she was the first person\NI ever saw with that kind of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until I met her, I was just\Nwandering aimlessly across worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing so was a lot easier on me\Nthan being with my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent my days in\Nneither sadness nor joy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and just went on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened one night\Nwhen there was a new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kodama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodama was able to control\Neverything here, any way she liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The others called her power "M," and\Nvenerated her as though she were a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,For goodness' sake,\Nwhat am I going to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much time passes,\Nyou're still so needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't come back here again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well in a bed\Nafter all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you have\Nsome kind of power, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... just a regular homeless guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A traveler, huh? That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a place\Nof my own, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We've traveled around to different\Nplaces before coming here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we finally found this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a very peaceful, easy world.\NAlmost unbelievably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how come you're all alone?\NYou didn't drift here by yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you're after?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything of value. Nor do I\Nhave a power that will be useful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me something—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear about\Nthe worlds you've been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't much to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's complete and utter nonsense.\NWe're all dying for new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, so, tell us all\Nabout it after supper, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, you can't just dictate...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little early still,\Nbut let's make it nighttime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,One with a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, it's suppertime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.51,0:08:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat me like a fool, will she...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, her kindness felt only disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys all seem so fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,625)}And it's not as though\Nany of them believed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't taste as good cold, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, while it's still hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, help yourself—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, damn it, damn it! And damn her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now. Your tongue\Nburns easily, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, just right. Here, try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:09:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Too salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. I must have\Nadded a bit too much salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had soup this\Nsalty before. It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, I'll be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so embarrassed\Nand frustrated by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...but also a little bit happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a surprisingly simple fellow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I think I can relate a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have even tried. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:10:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All I ever do is regret\Nthe things I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.07,0:11:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wasted most of my life doing so.\NThen I regret having done {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible. You must be\Na master at regretting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever have any regrets?\NLike, say, having drifted into this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was never given\Nthe freedom to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to school like normal,\Nand attended my classes like normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, here I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing there to regret\Neven if I wanted to. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, all we can do is move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I began thinking that this might be\Nthe final destination of my long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought those days would\Nkeep going on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd go on forever, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has he been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You found him because\Na bird was making noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You... are so ugly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are lots of rumors going around,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,wondering if that man\Nis the cause of this plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:13:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to abandon him,\Nif I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me that I was ugly after\Nhe looked at me. He didn't even hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He was nice enough to speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, if I can find out\Nwhat's causing these tumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can do something\Nabout them using my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?\NWhat do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...think that your idea is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Is that really what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. You're always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not as great a person as all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's kind of like you were...\Nwhen you had just barely arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked the other way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...from her mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have corrected\Nher choice at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It was probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...because I believed in her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...more than I believed in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and let me check you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You said the same thing yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's turned into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You just barely told him\Nthat he was all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me have a look. There's still—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If only {\i1}he {\i0}wasn't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who\Nbrought this illness here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we had only killed him back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:15:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that you were ugly,\Nbut that was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I thought\Nyou were beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you lie, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be liked by you. And,\Njust as I expected, you were pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you take people's feelings for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that question a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the cause of\Nthese tumors, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who brought them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I need you to tell me\Nhow to conquer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be able to cure these tumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Those wounds can't be healed by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you must understand...\Nthat I'm not all that's causing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you this! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:16:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty, isn't it? This is an award\Nyou get for killing a hundred people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is for a thousand.\NThis one is for ten thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Pretty, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. This always happens.\NI can't help but do the wrong thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then finally, people end up hating me.\NI don't know what I'm supposed to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come near us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, don't be so afraid of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of our sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! How come this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.95,0:16:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...always happens to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamabiko, you didn't fall ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No. And I hated that more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that it wasn't the plague that he\Nbrought, but a different "{\i1}This {\i0}World."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A world where mental wounds\Nmanifested as tumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:17:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He called that world "Scar Art."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is my art. I'm hoping\Nto collect many more of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you can touch it. Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't you want to know why\Nyou're the only one who hasn't taken ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell you. It's because\N{\i1}This {\i0}World is a world that you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't realized it until he said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to materialize\Nwhat was within my mind—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what my power was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At some point along the way, I had\Nbecome locked up inside my own shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why I alone\Ndidn't suffer from the illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and why, within those parameters,\NKodama's powers were meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is causing the wounds themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.03,0:18:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,are events happening somewhere\Noutside of {\i1}This {\i0}World.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You all had to resolve those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You just had to change yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All you had to do was break\Nout of your shell and fly out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's too late now. I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing that those of us\Nwho have been discarded can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice. You've heard\Nthe voice, too, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you, anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?\NWe've met before, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've seen me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In all sorts of places.\NAnd not just once, either; many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there, good boy, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you had a little more courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you could have saved her.\NShe's been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So eerily nice, but surprisingly dull—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,this world is you to a tee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I never mentioned, did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...that my name was War?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And after I kept\Ntelling him to fly away...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I did a bad thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't helped him, he could have\Nflown off to a faraway world somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was helping him, when\Nactually, I was hampering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you do anything I ask you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, someday, fulfill\Nthe promise you made to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to fly away from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, you'll do that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, a single dog was all\Nthat remained in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I had plenty of chances—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,chances to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I closed my eyes to all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Her wish was to walk together with me\Nin the outside world, that was all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She waited for me all that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:21:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet I was unable\Nto step up and respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to talk your ears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamabiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I sleep together with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1043)}Remember, you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's walk together
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,down that road made of\Nskeleton bones you once told me about,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,while we have some ice cream or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.80,0:21:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm. I have a lot on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "Why did I do what I did back then?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:22:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and "Why didn't I do {\i1}that{\i0}?"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,After thinking about all those things\Nthat I can't do anything about now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to accept the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so afraid of losing the light
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that I ended up not\Nbeing able to step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was finally able to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It took me 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nozomi! Long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly the time we agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I've been waiting two weeks since\Nthe day we were supposed to meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.45,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Our clocks are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:23:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The flow of time must have\Nbeen different for the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There, back in sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.21,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so all that happened on the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.35,0:23:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But who was this\N"War" guy fighting against?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.06,0:23:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His objective was to kill God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he were able to kill him...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that would change anything.
